pening the door to the next dungeon, as well as cheese, which is good for the adventuring mouse's stamina. The dungeon must be completed within a set time or it's game over.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/advenchuta", "videos": [{"id": 108249, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "szJ3lNYlAX4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=szJ3lNYlAX4", "title": "Adven-Chuta [MSX, rom, 1983 MIA]", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/szJ3lNYlAX4/hqdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 108250, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "cZzsUVGWK2w", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cZzsUVGWK2w", "title": "Adven'chuta // MSX // 2 loops (6 levels)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/cZzsUVGWK2w/hqdefault.jpg"}]}